1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,044
Payment successful. The customer sees a confirmation. But inside

2
00:00:04,044 --> 00:00:07,788
the business, the order says failed. The accounts show

3
00:00:07,788 --> 00:00:11,532
no money. And the payment processor says it was

4
00:00:11,532 --> 00:00:15,276
captured. Someone has to trace the missing message, compare

5
00:00:15,276 --> 00:00:19,020
the records, and decide what can safely be fixed.

6
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,785
That is where PayOps AI comes in. It brings

7
00:00:23,785 --> 00:00:27,649
the investigation, the evidence, and the verified outcome into

8
00:00:27,649 --> 00:00:31,514
one workspace. Specialists help find the cause. Policy controls

9
00:00:31,514 --> 00:00:34,520
the action. Every conclusion can be checked.

10
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:39,332
Let's see an example in the running application. These

11
00:00:39,332 --> 00:00:43,244
are simulated payments, using recorded model responses. The gateway

12
00:00:43,244 --> 00:00:47,156
captured one lakh twenty five thousand rupees. But the

13
00:00:47,156 --> 00:00:51,068
order is failed, the ledger is missing, and the

14
00:00:51,068 --> 00:00:54,980
webhook failed three times. The disagreement is visible immediately.

15
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,689
Start investigation begins the workflow. Code collects the minimum

16
00:00:59,689 --> 00:01:03,498
records first. The case then builds a readable story:

17
00:01:03,498 --> 00:01:07,307
what was checked, what was found, and why the

18
00:01:07,307 --> 00:01:09,000
next step was chosen.

19
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:14,020
A coordinator selects the specialists this case needs. Payment

20
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:18,140
examines the gateway and order. Reconciliation looks at accounting

21
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:22,260
and settlement. Risk reviews suspicious signals. This run shows

22
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:26,380
which specialists were chosen, what they actually did, and

23
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:30,500
the reasons behind their decisions. The workflow stays bounded.

24
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:35,414
Here is the proof. The payment specialist links its

25
00:01:35,414 --> 00:01:39,427
finding to this exact webhook record. Open it, and

26
00:01:39,427 --> 00:01:43,441
the original evidence shows three attempts, a failed delivery,

27
00:01:43,441 --> 00:01:47,454
and HTTP five hundred. The drawer also shows the

28
00:01:47,454 --> 00:01:51,468
current state. The explanation and the underlying record are

29
00:01:51,468 --> 00:01:52,360
visible together.

30
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:57,268
The proposed fix is to replay the failed message.

31
00:01:57,268 --> 00:02:01,277
Policy permits this state correction automatically. The executor applies

32
00:02:01,277 --> 00:02:05,285
it through code. The order becomes paid, the payment

33
00:02:05,285 --> 00:02:09,294
is captured internally, and accounting entries appear. Then an

34
00:02:09,294 --> 00:02:13,302
independent validator reads the records again. The checks pass,

35
00:02:13,302 --> 00:02:16,420
the systems agree, and the case closes.

36
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:21,564
A refund follows a different path. The proposal pauses

37
00:02:21,564 --> 00:02:25,808
for manager approval, with its amount and reason available

38
00:02:25,808 --> 00:02:30,053
for review. An authorized second person approves it. Execution

39
00:02:30,053 --> 00:02:34,297
continues only after that decision, and the result is

40
00:02:34,297 --> 00:02:35,240
verified again.

41
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:39,594
The audit trail records who acted and what changed.

42
00:02:39,594 --> 00:02:43,048
The run details connect those actions to the investigation.

43
00:02:43,048 --> 00:02:46,501
An operator can trace the decision and check the

44
00:02:46,501 --> 00:02:48,420
outcome, from the same case.

45
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:54,470
LangGraph coordinates the agents. Jev supplies typed decisions, and

46
00:02:54,470 --> 00:02:59,620
Gemini handles deeper investigation. Models propose from a fixed

47
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:04,770
action catalog. Code enforces policy, approval, and idempotent execution.

48
00:03:04,770 --> 00:03:09,920
Evidence checks and independent verification keep the result inspectable.

49
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:14,973
Find the cause. Open the proof. Apply a permitted

50
00:03:14,973 --> 00:03:19,126
